            ['start_time' => 381.12, 'end_time' => 387.02, 'target_text' => 'And I didn\'t know they were actually checking with a breathalyzer everybody because there was a nightclub nearby and they', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak tahu bahawa rupa-rupanya polis sedang membuat ujian alat pengesan alkohol (*breathalyzer*) kepada semua pemandu kerana ada kelab malam berdekatan,', 'order' => 91],
