            ['start_time' => 426.88, 'end_time' => 433.66, 'target_text' => 'I blew again." He says, "Sir, you are under arrest for driving under the influence of alcohol." I said, "What?', 'source_text' => 'Saya hembus lagi." Dia berkata, "Tuan, anda ditahan kerana memandu di bawah pengaruh alkohol." Saya kata, "Apa?', 'order' => 109],
