            ['start_time' => 588.08, 'end_time' => 588.7, 'target_text' => 'He said, "What?', 'source_text' => 'Dia terkejut dan berkata, "Apa?', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 588.8, 'end_time' => 591.82, 'target_text' => 'How did this happen?" I said, "I told you it was a throat spray.', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana ini boleh berlaku?" Saya kata, "Kan saya sudah beritahu ia berpunca daripada semburan tekak.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 591.92, 'end_time' => 596.54, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not there." Anyway, cut a long story short, the topic here is respect.', 'source_text' => 'Kini kandungannya sudah tiada." Ringkas ceritanya, pengajaran utama di sini ialah sifat saling menghormati.', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 596.64, 'end_time' => 605.42, 'target_text' => 'I believe that if I was vulgar, abusive, insulting, they would have taken me and made an example of me.', 'source_text' => 'Saya yakin jika saya bersikap kasar, mencaci, atau menghina mereka, mereka pasti sudah membawa dan mengambil tindakan tegas ke atas saya.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 605.52, 'end_time' => 609.74, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, I COULD HAVE gotten away with a 100 100 rand.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam sesetengah keadaan, seseorang mungkin boleh melepaskan diri dengan sogokan 100 rand.', 'order' => 164],
