            ['start_time' => 1199.92, 'end_time' => 1202.54, 'target_text' => 'In the interim, learn to respect one another.', 'source_text' => 'Sementara menunggu, belajarlah untuk saling menghormati antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1202.64, 'end_time' => 1204.3, 'target_text' => 'Learn to honor each other.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah untuk saling memuliakan.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1204.4, 'end_time' => 1213.58, 'target_text' => 'Learn to make sure you speak to people in a way that is befitting to your claim to Islam, your claim to being a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Pastikan anda bercakap dengan manusia dengan cara yang selayaknya mencerminkan pengakuan anda sebagai seorang Muslim sejati.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1213.68, 'end_time' => 1218.54, 'target_text' => 'It\'s embarrassing for us when something negative happens and we see it\'s a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Sungguh memalukan bagi kita apabila sesuatu yang buruk berlaku dan didapati pelakunya adalah seorang Muslim.', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1218.64, 'end_time' => 1224.62, 'target_text' => 'A few days ago, there was a Jewish man who uttered slurs against a Muslim brother.', 'source_text' => 'Beberapa hari lalu, ada seorang lelaki Yahudi melemparkan kata-kata kesat dan cercaan terhadap seorang saudara Muslim kita.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1224.72, 'end_time' => 1234.22, 'target_text' => 'I am almost certain he regrets it and his entire community regrets it because that moment of anger has given a picture that', 'source_text' => 'Saya amat yakin dia kini menyesalinya dan seluruh komunitinya berasa malu, kerana saat kemarahan tersebut telah memaparkan gambaran yang', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1234.32, 'end_time' => 1243.34, 'target_text' => 'is definitely not connected to any seemetic faith and by the way Islam is the a primary Seemetic faith.', 'source_text' => 'sama sekali tidak mencerminkan ajaran agama Samawi, sedangkan Islam itu sendiri adalah tonggak utama agama Samawi.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1243.44, 'end_time' => 1247.9, 'target_text' => 'So here we are embarrassment in the same way it happens to the Muslims.', 'source_text' => 'Maka di sinilah timbulnya rasa aib, sama seperti yang kadang-kadang berlaku kepada umat Islam.', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1248.0, 'end_time' => 1257.18, 'target_text' => 'Some of us the way we behave we regret later but that moment especially now in an age where everything is recorded it\'s an', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian daripada kita menyesali tindakan kita kemudian hari, tetapi detik itu, terutamanya pada zaman rakaman digital sekarang, ia mendatangkan', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1257.28, 'end_time' => 1264.86, 'target_text' => 'embarrassment just offer respect so what did you see the response of the guy who was uh holding the camera it was reasonably', 'source_text' => 'keaiban. Oleh itu berikanlah rasa hormat. Dan tidakkah anda melihat respon saudara kita yang memegang kamera itu? Dia kekal bersikap', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1264.96, 'end_time' => 1271.58, 'target_text' => 'respectful he said well you know whatever he said it wasn\'t vulgar he gave it back so we could sit and say wow you know what', 'source_text' => 'sopan, jawapan yang diberikan tidak mencarut, dia membalas dengan matang sehingga kita yang melihatnya berasa kagum dan berkata,', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1271.68, 'end_time' => 1277.74, 'target_text' => 'our guy did well right I tell you what there are thousands of clips the other way around but alhamdulillah they fizzled turned', 'source_text' => '"orang kita bertindak dengan sangat baik." Hakikatnya ada ribuan video sebaliknya yang berlaku, tetapi alhamdulillah perkara itu reda dan berakhir', 'order' => 353],
